 a return to SpiritSwap’s historical scale.","value":"No reviewed evidence supports a return to SpiritSwap’s historical scale.","as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"unknown","source_ids":["source:spiritswap:tvl","source:spiritswap:volume"],"evidence_locator":"Current metrics remain far below peak.","support_direction":"supports","note":null,"review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:spiritswap:metric:spot-volume-24h","field_path":"metrics[metric:spiritswap:spot-volume-24h:2026-08-03].value","assertion":"Spot volume, 24h was 511 USD for the stated scope and window.","value":511,"as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:spiritswap:volume"],"evidence_locator":"Provider response replayed between 2026-08-03T19:59:00Z and 2026-08-03T20:05:00Z; exact value retained in the research artifact.","support_direction":"supports","note":"Point-in-time provider observation; adapters may revise same-day values and must not be combined across unlike scopes.","review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:spiritswap:metric:spot-volume-30d","field_path":"metrics[metric:spiritswap:spot-volume-30d:2026-08-03].value","assertion":"Spot volume, 30d was 31309 USD for the stated scope and window.","value":31309,"as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:spiritswap:volume"],"evidence_locator":"Provider response replayed between 2026-08-03T19:59:00Z and 2026-08-03T20:05:00Z; exact value retained in the research artifact.","support_direction":"supports","note":"Point-in-time provider observation; adapters may revise same-day values and must not be combined across unlike scopes.","review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:spiritswap:metric:tvl-latest","field_path":"metrics[metric:spiritswap:tvl-latest:2026-08-03].value","assertion":"Current TVL was 229706 USD for the stated scope and window.","value":229706,"as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:spiritswap:tvl"],"evidence_locator":"Provider response replayed between 2026-08-03T19:59:00Z and 2026-08-03T20:05:00Z; exact value retained in the research artifact.","support_direction":"supports","note":"Point-in-time provider observation; adapters may revise same-day values and must not be combined across unlike scopes.","review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:spiritswap:metric:tvl-peak","field_path":"metrics[metric:spiritswap:tvl-peak:2022-01-17].value","assertion":"Historical peak TVL was 373029262 USD for the stated scope and window.","value":373029262,"as_of":"2022-01-17","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:spiritswap:tvl"],"evidence_locator":"Provider response replayed between 2026-08-03T19:59:00Z and 2026-08-03T20:05:00Z; exact value retained in the research artifact.","support_direction":"supports","note":"Point-in-time provider observation; adapters may revise same-day values and must not be combined across unlike scopes.","review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:spiritswap:metric:fees-30d","field_path":"metrics[metric:spiritswap:fees-30d:2026-08-03].value","assertion":"Trading fees, 30d was 95 USD for the stated scope and window.","value":95,"as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:spiritswap:fees"],"evidence_locator":"Provider response replayed between 2026-08-03T19:59:00Z and 2026-08-03T20:05:00Z; exact value retained in the research artifact.","support_direction":"supports","note":"Point-in-time provider observation; adapters may revise same-day values and must not be combined across unlike scopes.","review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:spiritswap:metric:revenue-30d","field_path":"metrics[metric:spiritswap:revenue-30d:2026-08-03].value","assertion":"Protocol revenue, 30d was 13.85 USD for the stated scope and window.","value":13.85,"as_of":"2026-08-03","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:spiritswap:revenue"],"evidence_locator":"Provider response replayed between 2026-08-03T19:59:00Z and 2026-08-03T20:05:00Z; exact value retained in the research artifact.","support_direction":"supports","note":"Point-in-time provider observation; adapters may revise same-day values and must not be combined across unlike scopes.","review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:spiritswap:event:shutdown-announced","field_path":"events[event:spiritswap:shutdown-announced]","assertion":"SpiritSwap announced a September shutdown after Multichain-linked treasury losses removed its operating budget.","value":"2023-08-09","as_of":"2023-08-09","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:spiritswap:shutdown","source:spiritswap:treasury-context"],"evidence_locator":"Contemporary independent reports.","support_direction":"supports","note":null,"review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}},{"id":"claim:spiritswap:event:rescue-approved","field_path":"events[event:spiritswap:rescue-approved]","assertion":"Users approved transfer to Power with a reported $200,000 USDC treasury commitment.","value":"2023-08-16","as_of":"2023-08-16","confidence":"high","kind":"fact","source_ids":["source:spiritswap:rescue"],"evidence_locator":"Contemporary rescue report.","support_direction":"supports","note":null,"review":{"state":"pending","reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null}}],"freshness":{"state":"current","last_reviewed_at":"2026-08-03T20:05:00Z","next_review_at":"2026-08-10T20:05:00Z","field_reviews":[]},"quality":{"publication_state":"review","completeness_pct":100,"confidence":"high","unsourced_fields":["Current control map","Post-handoff liabilities","Recurring users","Current inSPIRIT distributions"]},"extensions":{"legacy_origin":"mid_exchanges","observation_window":{"started_at":"2026-08-03T19:59:00Z","completed_at":"2026-08-03T20:05:00Z"},"explicit_unknowns":["Who currently controls SpiritSwap contracts, treasury, frontend and governance?","What liabilities and Multichain-linked losses remained after the 2023 handoff?","How many recurring users generate current volume?","Whether current inSPIRIT fee distributions function and are economically material?"],"identity_boundary":"This profile covers SpiritSwap’s Fantom AMM, farms and SPIRIT/inSPIRIT system. Multichain was external bridge and treasury infrastructure, not SpiritSwap itself. The Power rescue preserved the venue but did not merge all Power products into SpiritSwap. A live website, residual contracts or Fantom chain activity does not by itself prove healthy SpiritSwap operation.","methodology_notes":["Every material field is attached to atomic pending claims; a person must review those claims before the report can be published.","Routed volume is not additive to underlying DEX volume, TVL is not market depth, fees are not profit, residual balances are not an operating venue, and observed co-movement is not causation.","Documented decisions, observed outcomes, analyst inferences and unresolved unknowns are kept separate.","The current interface displays zero and NaN headline figures; those broken fields are not treated as market data.","Nonzero adapter activity supports operating continuity but not verified team solvency, successful user execution or healthy token distributions."]}}', '{"kind":"dex","slug":"spiritswap","lifecycle":"mid","operating_model":"Rescued Fantom spot AMM with SPIRIT farming and inSPIRIT governance.","product_cohort":"single_chain_spot_amm","custody_model":"non_custodial","primary_chain":"Fantom Opera","chains":["Fantom Opera"],"token_status":"launched","token_symbol":"SPIRIT","token_launch_date":null,"token_launch_timing":"at_or_near_launch","token_strategy":"liquidity_emissions_vote_lock_governance_and_fee_share","token_source_url":"https://www.spiritswap.finance/","metric_type":"spot_volume","metric_unit":"usd","metric_window":"rolling_30_days","metric_as_of":"2026-08-03","metric_observed_at":"2026-08-03T19:59:00Z","comparability_key":"dex|single_chain_spot_amm|spot_volume|usd|rolling_30_days","evidence":{"canonical_profile":true,"claims_pending_human_review":true,"identity_boundary":"This profile covers SpiritSwap’s Fantom AMM, farms and SPIRIT/inSPIRIT system. Multichain was external bridge and treasury infrastructure, not SpiritSwap itself. The Power rescue preserved the venue but did not merge all Power products into SpiritSwap. A live website, residual contracts or Fantom chain activity does not by itself prove healthy SpiritSwap operation.","metric_replayed_at":"2026-08-03T19:59:00Z","source_count":11},"quality_label":"verified","quality_issues":[],"lifecycle_evidence_date":"2026-08-03","last_verified_at":"2026-08-03","next_review_at":"2026-08-10","freshness_status":"current","updated_at":"2026-08-03"}');

INSERT INTO _dex_wave_h_profiles_0089 (
  target_table, slug, canonical_profile, feature
) VALUES ('dead_exchanges', 'uranium-finance', '{"schema":"chaindump-entity-profile","version":1,"identity":{"id":"dex:uranium-finance","type":"dex","slug":"uranium-finance","name":"Uranium Finance","aliases":["Uranium","Uranium AMM"]},"classification":{"subtype":"closed BNB Chain constant-product AMM and yield farm","tags":["spot_amm","yield_farm","bnb_chain","repeat_exploit","closed"],"chains":["BNB Chain"],"jurisdictions":[]},"status":{"operating_state":"closed","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:uranium-finance:status"]},"outcome":{"label":"failed_after_repeat_exploits","as_of":"2026-08-03","rule_id":"exchange-lifecycle-v1","confidence":"high","claim_ids":["claim:uranium-finance:outcome"]},"analysis":{"sections":{"what_it_is":{"body":"Uranium Finance was a non-custodial AMM and yield farm on BNB Chain. It forked the familiar constant-product exchange model, let LPs deposit token pairs, and used a native U92 token in its farming system. It launched and failed in April 2021. This record is only about that crypto protocol; it is unrelated to physical uranium or later uranium-branded assets.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:uranium-finance:section:what_it_is:1","claim:uranium-finance:section:what_it_is:2","claim:uranium-finance:section:what_it_is:3"]},"what_happened":{"body":"Uranium suffered two attacks in April 2021. A March 2026 indictment alleges that the April 8 attack manipulated reward logic and extracted about $1.4 million. On April 28, a separate attacker transaction exploited a V2 pair-contract arithmetic error across 26 pools. Contemporary reports estimated roughly $50 million lost; the indictment alleges about $53.3 million. The venue shut down. U.S. authorities seized cryptocurrency worth about $31 million in February 2025, but seizure is not the same as victim repayment and the criminal allegations have not been proven.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:uranium-finance:section:what_happened:1","claim:uranium-finance:section:what_happened:2","claim:uranium-finance:section:what_happened:3"]},"why_this_outcome":{"body":"The fatal second exploit came from Uranium’s own code change, not from BNB Chain. Developers changed the fee calculation to use 10,000-scale arithmetic but left the invariant check on a 1,000-scale assumption. That mismatch let a caller provide a small input while withdrawing nearly all pool reserves. The venue had already survived a separate reward attack earlier in the month and was preparing another migration. Repeated control failures plus a loss larger than any credible reserve ended the exchange. Actor attribution remains an allegation; the code defect and closure have independent support.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:uranium-finance:section:why_this_outcome:1","claim:uranium-finance:section:why_this_outcome:2","claim:uranium-finance:section:why_this_outcome:3"]},"strategic_choices":{"body":"Uranium chose to fork a proven AMM design and modify fee arithmetic for its own economics. That accelerated launch but made a tiny deviation in asset-conservation logic catastrophic. After the first April attack, the project continued operating and migrated to V2 while another V2.1 update was planned. The team did not pause all liquidity until the changed invariant had been independently verified. Those were product and release choices; BNB Chain provided execution but did not choose the faulty constants.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:uranium-finance:section:strategic_choices:1","claim:uranium-finance:section:strategic_choices:2","claim:uranium-finance:section:strategic_choices:3"]},"operating_model":{"body":"Uranium matched traders inside constant-product pools funded by LPs and added farming rewards through U92. In a healthy AMM, every swap must leave the adjusted reserve product at or above the invariant after fees. Uranium’s V2 check failed that basic conservation rule, so the second attacker could drain reserves across many pairs. The model had no disclosed insurance or recapitalization capacity able to absorb the loss. Once pool assets disappeared, token emissions could not recreate user claims or market trust.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:uranium-finance:section:operating_model:1","claim:uranium-finance:section:operating_model:2","claim:uranium-finance:section:operating_model:3"]},"token_and_value_capture":{"body":"U92 was Uranium’s native token and part of its farming economy; contemporary reporting counted about 112,000 U92 among assets drained in the second exploit. The surviving public record does not establish a durable fee claim, governance right, fixed emission schedule or recovery entitlement for holders. Whatever incentive role U92 had disappeared with the venue’s liquidity and operations. Legal seizures concern allegedly stolen assets and do not revive U92 or create a successor token.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:uranium-finance:section:token_and_value_capture:1","claim:uranium-finance:section:token_and_value_capture:2","claim:uranium-finance:section:token_and_value_capture:3"]},"counterfactual":{"body":"The direct prevention path was technical: differential testing against the upstream pair contract, invariant-based property tests for every fee setting, and an independent review of each changed arithmetic constant. After the first incident, a full pause until V2 and V2.1 passed those tests would have traded availability for safety. A capped migration with per-pool limits could also have reduced blast radius. These controls would address the documented defect, but they cannot prove every attack or alleged actor would have been stopped.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:uranium-finance:section:counterfactual:1","claim:uranium-finance:section:counterfactual:2","claim:uranium-finance:section:counterfactual:3"]},"risks_and_unknowns":{"body":"The exchange is closed, so remaining risks are claimant recovery, misleading old interfaces or tokens, forgotten approvals and uncertainty around residual contracts. The legal case may clarify attribution and forfeiture, but the indictment is only an accusation. Authorities reported a $31 million seizure, not a completed distribution. Unknowns include final case disposition, recoverable value after legal process, every pre-deployment audit, remaining contract permissions and how losses divide among LPs and other users.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:uranium-finance:section:risks_and_unknowns:1","claim:uranium-finance:section:risks_and_unknowns:2","claim:uranium-finance:section:risks_and_unknowns:3"]},"lifecycle":{"body":"Uranium launched on BNB Chain in early 2021 and combined an AMM with aggressive farming. An April 8 reward exploit removed about $1.4 million according to later federal allegations. The project continued, moved into V2 and prepared another migration. On April 28, the faulty invariant check was exploited across 26 pools, removing roughly $50 million to $53.3 million and forcing closure. A 2025 seizure and 2026 indictment reopened the recovery and attribution story, not the exchange. Uranium Finance remains dead.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:uranium-finance:section:lifecycle:1","claim:uranium-finance:section:lifecycle:2","claim:uranium-finance:section:lifecycle:3"]},"outlook_and_watch":{"body":"There is no operating outlook for Uranium Finance. Watch the criminal docket, forfeiture orders, victim-claim instructions, asset-distribution records and any verified warning about residual contracts. A legal recovery can improve creditor outcomes without changing the failure classification. Any separately funded exchange using similar code, branding or tokens must receive its own identity, contracts and evidence. Until victims receive distributions, Chaindump should report seized value separately from recovered value.","as_of":"2026-08-03","claim_ids":["claim:uranium-finance:section:outlook_and_watch:1","claim:uranium-finance:section:outlook_and_watch:2","claim:uranium-finance:section:outlook_and_watch:3"]}}},"metrics":[{"id":"metric:uranium-finance:first-exploit-loss:2021-04-08","dimension":"exploit_loss","label":"First exploit amount alleged","value":1400000,"unit":"usd","currency":"USD","window":{"start":null,"end":"2021-04-08","definition":"incident estimate"},"as_of":"2021-04-08","method":"Indictment allegation for the April 8 incident.","scope":{"product":"exchange venue","chains":[]},"formula":null,"raw_input_ids":[],"claim_ids":["claim:uranium-finance:metric:first-exploit-loss"],"quality_flags":["indictment_allegation","not_final_finding"]},{"id":"metric:uranium-finance:second-exploit-loss-authority:2021-04-28","dimension":"exploit_loss","label":"Second exploit amount alleged","value":53300000,"unit":"usd","currency":"USD","window":{"start":null,"end":"2021-04-28","definition":"incident estimate"},"as_of":"2021-04-28","method":"Indictment allegation across 26 pools.","scope":{"product":"exchange venue","chains":[]},"formula":null,"raw_input_ids":[],"claim_ids":["claim:uranium-finance:metric:second-exploit-loss-authority"],"quality_flags":["indictment_allegation","not_final_finding"]},{"id":"metric:uranium-finance:second-exploit-loss-contemporary:2021-04-28","dimension":"exploit_loss","label":"Second exploit contemporary estimate","value":50000000,"unit":"usd","currency":"USD","window":{"start":null,"end":"2021-04-28","definition":"incident estimate"},"as_of":"2021-04-28","method":"Rounded contemporary independent estimate; not additive to the authority estimate.","scope":{"product":"exchange venue","chains":[]},"formula":null,"raw_input_ids":[],"claim_ids":["claim:uranium-finance:metric:second-exploit-loss-contemporary"],"quality_flags":["rounded_estimate","same_incident_as_authority_measure"]},{"id":"metric:uranium-finance:assets-seized:2025-02-24","dimension":"exploit_recovery","label":"Assets seized, not distributed","value":31000000,"unit":"usd","currency":"USD","window":{"start":null,"end":"2025-02-24","definition":